  "notes": "Inspired by Bon Appétit's jalapeño-marinated chops. Rib chops with a fat cap stay juicier than center-cut loin. Pull them at 60°C; they rise to a rosy 63°C as they rest. Don't marinate more than 8 hours; the vinegar starts to cure the meat.",
